+          }
+        }
+      }
+    }
+  }
+}
+--------------------------------------------------
+// TEST[setup:sales]
+<1> Histogram is grouped by month.
+<2> Calculate number of of all sale prices
+<3> Convert to annual counts
+<4> Changing the mode to value count
+
